{"title":"Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3 data-end=\"132\" data-start=\"66\" data-section-id=\"t9thg1\"\u003eDiscover the Snow-Kissed Beauty of the Prince Flock Collection\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"503\" data-start=\"134\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe Prince Flock artificial Christmas tree collection from Carol's Christmas Conifers brings the classic magic of a snow-covered Christmas tree into your home with effortless elegance. Featuring heavily flocked branches, a full and uniform silhouette, and timeless styling, the Prince Flock is a beloved holiday centerpiece that feels both nostalgic and completely at home in a modern space\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"957\" data-start=\"791\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eAvailable in both full and pencil silhouettes, the Prince Flock collection makes it easy to bring the magic of a flocked Christmas tree into spaces both large and small.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhy choose the Prince Flock?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe Prince Flock is the ideal choice for those who love the classic, snow-covered look of a traditional flocked Christmas tree. \u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe flocked finish adds a layer of wintry warmth and nostalgia that transforms any room into a holiday retreat.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eShould I choose the full or pencil Prince Flock?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe Prince Flock collection is available in both full and pencil silhouettes to suit a variety of spaces and decorating preferences.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe full Prince Flock provides a wide, traditional Christmas tree shape with generous branch spread and a commanding snowy presence. It is best suited for larger living rooms, open spaces, or anywhere you want a bold, classic flocked tree to anchor your holiday décor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe pencil Prince Flock delivers the same heavily flocked finish and appearance in a slim, upright profile. It is a great option for apartments, narrower rooms, hallways, or entryways.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhat decorating style works best with the Prince Flock?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe Prince Flock's heavily flocked white branches make it one of the most versatile trees to decorate. Its snowy finish pairs beautifully with classic red and gold holiday palettes, cool silver and blue tones, warm candlelight and cream accents, and rustic or cozy winter-inspired styling.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eIs the Prince Flock available pre-lit or unlit?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe Prince Flock collection is available in both pre-lit and unlit options to accommodate your decorating preferences.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eOur pre-lit Prince Flock artificial Christmas trees feature professionally installed lighting that glows warmly through the snowy flock finish, creating a soft and magical winter atmosphere. With Power Pole Technology, setup is effortless — no tangled cords, no complicated connections. Simply assemble, connect, and your tree lights up instantly.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eHow long does it take to shape the Prince Flock?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eLike most 100% PVC artificial Christmas trees, the Prince Flock benefits from a dedicated shaping session when you first set it up. Plan to spend approximately 1–3 hours working through the branches, separating, fanning, and positioning each tip by hand to build out the fullness of the tree. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe effort is worth it. Once properly shaped, the Prince Flock looks completely full and lush from top to bottom. \u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eMinimal shedding of the flocking is expected during initial set up. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhat is the difference between the Prince Flock and the King Flock?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe Prince Flock and \u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/king-flock-trees\" title=\"King Flock Artificial Christmas Trees\"\u003eKing Flock\u003c\/a\u003e share the same heavily flocked finish and wintry aesthetic, but differ in their branch construction. The Prince Flock is crafted with 100% PVC classic tips, delivering a full, uniform appearance with the traditional look of a classic flocked Christmas tree. The King Flock is crafted with mixed PE and PVC foliage, which adds greater texture, depth, and a more detailed branch structure for a slightly more elevated, lifelike appearance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eIs the Prince Flock easy to assemble and store?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eYes. The Prince Flock is designed for easy setup, reliable long-term use, and convenient after-season storage. Its hinged branch construction allows branches to fall naturally into place during assembly, giving you a solid foundation to build on as you work through the shaping process.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eEach tree includes a sturdy stand and complimentary setup gloves to help you shape and arrange the branches comfortably during assembly. A complimentary storage bag is also included to keep your tree and its flock finish protected between seasons.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhen the holidays are over, the Prince Flock disassembles easily and stores neatly in a cool, dry place, keeping it in great condition for many seasons to come.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eExplore the full Prince Flock collection and find the size and silhouette that brings the magic of a winter wonderland into your home this holiday season.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"8-foot-prince-flock-tree-unlit","title":"8' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642895167552,"sku":"PF-T8-U","price":219.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-11_5e399119-a4fe-4d26-8c77-bde58886c97f.jpg?v=1718158952"},{"product_id":"6-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"6' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 350 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642895921216,"sku":"PF-T6-L","price":249.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_fbb2edf4-c5c9-4ad1-b201-ca0c1c1c4b0e.jpg?v=1714675465"},{"product_id":"7-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"7' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 400 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":41965569769672,"sku":"PF-T7-L","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_fa622227-8cc4-441c-b46e-a6f7c09044bd.jpg?v=1714675463"},{"product_id":"8-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"8' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 550 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642896379968,"sku":"PF-T8-L","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_5024a958-646c-4413-8cbb-72107e8ba72d.jpg?v=1714675448"},{"product_id":"9-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"9' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 650 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":28642896576576,"sku":"PF-T9-L","price":599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_4d66d600-8734-493e-9b99-6279743376a5.jpg?v=1714675446"},{"product_id":"10-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"10' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 750 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"10' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642896707648,"sku":"PF-T10-L","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_5024a958-646c-4413-8cbb-72107e8ba72d_1.jpg?v=1761241980"},{"product_id":"9-foot-prince-flock-pencil-tree-led","title":"9' Prince Flock® Pencil Artificial Christmas Tree with 600 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":29211288666176,"sku":"PFP-T9-L","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrincePencilTreeLED.jpg?v=1786129938"},{"product_id":"7-foot-prince-flock-pencil-tree-led","title":"7' Prince Flock® Pencil Artificial Christmas Tree with 400 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42854044139720,"sku":"PFP-T7-L","price":249.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrincePencilTreeLED.jpg?v=1786129938"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/11_1_2000x.progressive_920030df-80d7-46e8-ab8a-552e8c12fda7.jpg?v=1722361686","url":"/\/collections\/prince-flock-trees.oembed","provider":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","version":"1.0","type":"link"}